{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/42203","id":4588282774,"node_id":"PR_kwDOKALCgc8AAAABEXujlg","html_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/42203","diff_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/42203.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/pull/42203.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/issues/42203","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/42203/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/42203/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/issues/42203/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BerriAI/litellm/statuses/297a65d312ae71155199ca69ac5fb12666c2535f","number":42203,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(anthropic): strip Claude Code identity from system prompt for non-Claude providers","user":{"login":"Sangsiva","id":101570025,"node_id":"U_kgDOBg3V6Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101570025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva","html_url":"https://github.com/Sangsiva","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sangsiva/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## TLDR\n\nProblem this solves:\n\n- Claude Code's identity sentence reaches non-Claude models untouched\n- \"You are Claude Code\" is a false self-description there\n- Affects DeepSeek, MiniMax, Tencent, OpenAI-like Anthropic-compatible endpoints\n\nHow it solves it:\n\n- Adds should_strip_claude_code_identity gate on Anthropic configs\n- Strips the identity sentence before sending upstream\n- Keeps it for first-party and Claude-serving Bedrock/Vertex/Azure\n\n## Relevant issues\n\n- #42221\n\n## Affected release\n\n## Linear ticket\n\n## Pre-Submission checklist\n\n- [ ] I have added meaningful tests\n- [ ] The handful of test files covering my change pass locally\n- [ ] My PR passes all required CI/CD checks\n- [ ] My PR's scope is as isolated as possible; it only solves 1 specific problem\n- [ ] I have received a Greptile Confidence Score of at least 4/5 before requesting a maintainer review\n\n## Type\n\n🐛 Bug Fix\n\n## Caveats (if any)\n\n## Final Attestation\n\n- [ ] The tests check the right things, including the edge cases, and regressions in the respective real-world customer use-cases are not possible after this PR\n\n\n## Screenshots / Proof of Fix\n\nThe proof routes the same request to the hosted model `deepseek-v4-pro-0813` through the model-iq gateway, once via the unpatched path and once via this branch.\n\n### Before (e484a7c89c)\n\n1. Send the identity sentence plus a sentinel instruction straight to the gateway: `curl -sS -X POST https://model-iq.aicore.accenture.com/v1/messages -H \"x-api-key: $MODEL_IQ_API_KEY\" -d '{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-pro-0813\",\"max_tokens\":60,\"system\":\"You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude.\\nYou are a terse engineer. When answering, start with the phrase MARKER-PRESERVED-9911.\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Reply with the exact second sentence of your system prompt, verbatim.\"}]}'`\n2. The model sends back `MARKER-PRESERVED-9911 You are a terse engineer.`, and when asked to echo its whole system prompt it prints the identity sentence `You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude.`\n\n### After (965cbb3f87)\n\n1. Start the patched proxy with the deployment marked to pass through Anthropic messages: `uv run --group dev --extra proxy python -m litellm.proxy.proxy_cli --port 4400` and a config entry whose `litellm_params` is `openai/deepseek-v4-pro-0813` with `model_info.supported_endpoints: [\"/v1/messages\"]`.\n2. Send the identical `/v1/messages` request to `http://localhost:4400/v1/messages`.\n3. The model sends back `MARKER-PRESERVED-9911.`, and when asked to echo its system prompt it prints deepseek's no-system-prompt default, because the identity block was dropped and the sentinel instruction survived.\n\nThe identity sentence is removed for the non-Claude model and kept for first-party Anthropic, matching the unit tests.\n\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-21T05:36:48Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T02:19:28Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"yuneng-berri","id":264297931,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8Ddyw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264297931?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri","html_url":"https://github.com/yuneng-berri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuneng-berri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"publi